---
description: Protected evidence and fixture requirements
globs: ["examples/**", "tests/**", "src/neuroai_workbench/evidence.py", "src/neuroai_workbench/exporter.py"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Use synthetic or explicitly public fixtures only.
- Never commit private neural data, participant records, credentials, confidential regulator files, or decryption material.
- Treat exports and backups as protected copies.
- Hash identity does not establish authenticity, relevance, or methodological adequacy.
- Preserve evidence-holder, access-state, and authorization metadata when extending the model.
